cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying manuscript."
type: software
title: "cattlePanSVimp: pangenome structural variant imputation workflows for cattle"
abstract: >-
  Workflows for building pangenome-based variant panels, benchmarking structural
  variant imputation across marker densities (LD chip, HD chip, WGS SNP, RNA SNP),
  and running downstream GWAS on the imputed genotypes.
authors:
